# Delivery Guy — environment variables
#
# NOTHING HERE IS USED BY THE SITE ITSELF.
# index.html / styles.css / main.js are static files served straight to the
# browser: there is no build step and no server, so a key written into them
# is public. Never commit a real key to this repo.
#
# These variables are for the optional holder-count proxy described in
# README section 2 — a small serverless function that keeps the key
# server-side, calls one of the indexers below, and answers with JSON like
# {"holders": 1234}. Point CONFIG.holdersApiUrl in main.js at that proxy.
#
# Copy this file to .env (already gitignored) and fill in ONE of them.

# The token this is all about.
TOKEN_MINT=2RbedkHKGCfJ7NyeQBGWSParreAzSeAn6D8GHqLzpump

# Helius — https://dashboard.helius.dev  (free tier)
HELIUS_API_KEY=

# Birdeye — https://bds.birdeye.so  (free tier, sent as the X-API-KEY header)
BIRDEYE_API_KEY=

# Solscan Pro — https://pro-api.solscan.io  (sent as the token header)
SOLSCAN_API_KEY=
